    <title>Changing the name of a node</title>
  </head>
  <body bgcolor="#ffffff">
    <h1>
       <img border="0" hspace="0" height="32" width="32" src=
      "../../../../images/carmenHelpIcons/c3_32.gif">&nbsp; Changing the name of a node
    </h1>
    <p>
      &nbsp;
    </p>
    <table border="1" cellpadding="7" style=
    " page-break-inside: auto; page-break-before: auto; page-break-after: auto;" cellspacing="0"
    bordercolor="#000000" width="491">
      <col width="230">
      <col width="231"><THEAD>
      <tr>
        <td colspan="2" valign="top" width="475">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <b><font size="3">Use case: Changing the name of a node</font></b>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td colspan="2" valign="top" width="475">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <b><font size="3">Actor: User</font></b>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="230">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <b><font size="3">Normal course</font></b>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="231">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <b><font size="3">Alternative courses</font></b>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      </THEAD><TBODY>
    </table>
    <table>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="230">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <font size="3">1.During the edition of the properties of a node, the name of the node
            which is being edited is changed.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="231">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="230">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <font size="3">2.The change of the name is notified to its child nodes to update the
            different table of potentials.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="231">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="230">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <font size="3">3.A new point to undo and redo the change of the name of the node is
            created.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="231">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      </TBODY>
    </table>
